Third-party components
----------------------
The following are included in or used by this project and remain under their
own licenses; the notice above does not apply to them.

- astronomy-engine.js — Astronomy Engine, Copyright (c) 2019-2023 Don Cross.
  MIT License; the full text is at the top of the file.
  https://github.com/cosinekitty/astronomy

- Astrocartography map data, all from Natural Earth (public domain),
  https://www.naturalearthdata.com:
  world-map.js — 1:110m land and lakes, 1:50m state/province lines;
  roads.js — 1:10m main roads;
  tiles/relief/ — Natural Earth II with Shaded Relief, Water and Drainages, 1:10m,
  reprojected and tiled (tools/build-map-tiles.py).

- places.js — place names, coordinates and time zones from GeoNames
  (https://www.geonames.org), licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
  International License (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). The data
  was reduced to places of 5,000+ people and reformatted (tools/build-places.py).

- tz-history.js — pre-1970 time zone history from the IANA Time Zone Database
  (public domain). https://www.iana.org/time-zones

- Chiron starting states (CHIRON_STARTS in ephemeris.js) — from the NASA JPL
  Horizons system, Solar System Dynamics Group, Jet Propulsion Laboratory
  (2060 Chiron, orbit solution JPL#171). https://ssd.jpl.nasa.gov/horizons/

- fonts/ — DM Mono (Copyright 2020 The DM Mono Project Authors), Manrope
  (Copyright 2018 The Manrope Project Authors) and Playfair Display (Copyright 2017
  The Playfair Display Project Authors, Reserved Font Name "Playfair Display"),
  SIL Open Font License 1.1; each font's license is in fonts/OFL-*.txt.


